    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pirates &amp; Pirater</i> is an\u00a0<strong>Action-Adventure</strong> where pirates have replaced their metal arsenal with fruit, meat &amp; vegetables! <strong>Cook</strong> up your armory, <strong>eat</strong> your weaponry &amp; <strong>fight as</strong>\u00a0a true culinary pirate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/dc07784ee67ec6b1d57d5b0bdaa536ac.avif?t=1744883320\" width=620 height=180 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.poster.avif?t=1744883320\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.webm?t=1744883320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.mp4?t=1744883320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Utilize</strong> your menu of weapons and abilities to combat your way through the pirate hierarchy! Take up the fight by altering your tasty recipes and cooking the tools you need to change the five-star course of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover </strong>new ingredients to implement in your armory, <strong>unlock </strong>new recipes to expand your arsenal &amp; <strong>battle</strong> the pantheon of pirate lords! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liberate </strong>your way through the diverse levels and areas inhabited by quirky characters and enemies as you clear out the evil that has taken hold in <i>Gustav\u2019s Archipelago</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/9610442e273d5ad20ec06a4c67f27ad1.avif?t=1744883320\" width=620 height=180 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.poster.avif?t=1744883320\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.webm?t=1744883320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.mp4?t=1744883320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore </strong>a succulent world ruled by a clan of <strong>soup-worshipping pirates</strong> as you embark on a culinary adventure filled with savory treasures, tantalizing flavors, and delicious discoveries at every bite! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends, foes, and adventure await you in <i>Pirates &amp; Pirater</i>! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/16ac881dedb261cbd81602dce0c235e8.avif?t=1744883320\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pirates &amp; Pirater</i> is an\u00a0<strong>Action-Adventure</strong> where pirates have replaced their metal arsenal with fruit, meat &amp; vegetables! <strong>Cook</strong> up your armory, <strong>eat</strong> your weaponry &amp; <strong>fight as</strong>\u00a0a true culinary pirate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/dc07784ee67ec6b1d57d5b0bdaa536ac.avif?t=1744883320\" width=620 height=180 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.poster.avif?t=1744883320\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.webm?t=1744883320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/b0efded8e1df89765792d2716424a197.mp4?t=1744883320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Utilize</strong> your menu of weapons and abilities to combat your way through the pirate hierarchy! Take up the fight by altering your tasty recipes and cooking the tools you need to change the five-star course of history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover </strong>new ingredients to implement in your armory, <strong>unlock </strong>new recipes to expand your arsenal &amp; <strong>battle</strong> the pantheon of pirate lords! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Liberate </strong>your way through the diverse levels and areas inhabited by quirky characters and enemies as you clear out the evil that has taken hold in <i>Gustav\u2019s Archipelago</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/9610442e273d5ad20ec06a4c67f27ad1.avif?t=1744883320\" width=620 height=180 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.poster.avif?t=1744883320\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.webm?t=1744883320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/48a5c3fc1fd6a785d5da6a284f123749.mp4?t=1744883320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore </strong>a succulent world ruled by a clan of <strong>soup-worshipping pirates</strong> as you embark on a culinary adventure filled with savory treasures, tantalizing flavors, and delicious discoveries at every bite! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Friends, foes, and adventure await you in <i>Pirates &amp; Pirater</i>! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727960/extras/16ac881dedb261cbd81602dce0c235e8.avif?t=1744883320\" width=620 height=180 /></span></p>",
